  data: {
    LLM: 'Game: Zwanzigerrufen. Logic: See rules.objective and rules.gameplay.',
    Player: "Zwanzigerrufen ('Call the Twenty') is an Austrian Tarot game. 4 players. 40-card deck (from 54-card Industrie und Glück). 20 Tarocks + 20 suit cards. Declarer calls Tarock XX to find secret partner. Win 45+ of 88 card points. Simpler than Königrufen. Trull cards: Pagát(I), Mond(XXI), Sküs = 5pts each.",
    objective: "The declarer's team (or soloist) must win at least 45 of the 88 card points in tricks to win the game. In a normal game the calling team plays against the defenders; the first team to reach 45 or more points wins.",
    gameplay: 'Declarer calls Tarock XX = secret partner. Follow suit, must trump if void. Trull (I, XXI, Sküs) = 5pts each. K=5, Q=4, Knight=3, J=2, others=1. Total=88.',
